# Goal: find returns the ID of a commit with the requested message.
> init
<<<
+ f.txt wug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "target message"
<<<
D DATE "Date: \w{3} \w{3} \d{2} \d{2}:\d{2}:\d{2} \d{4} [-+]\d{4}"
> log
===
commit ([a-f0-9]{40})
${DATE}
target message

(?:.|\n)*
<<<*
D TARGET "${1}"
> find "target message"
${TARGET}
<<<
